  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FN&apos;s globala mekanism f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad genomslag f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga      r&#xe4;ttigheter och r&#xe4;ttighetsperspektivet i FN&apos;s utvecklingsorgan. Det   &#xe4;r ett samarbete mellan 18 centrala FN organ                          (OHCHR,UNDP,UNICEF,UNFPA,UN Women,ILO, UNEP, WHO mfl.)                 Syftet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka FN&apos;s och mottagarl&#xe4;ndernas kapacitet att        implementera m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to United Nations Human Rights Mainstreaming Mechanism. It is a cooperation among 18 UN development agencies. The purpose is to     strengthen UN coherence in relation to human rights and strengthen UN development agencies capacity to work from a Human rights based       approach in the field.</narrative>
  </description>
